  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.54 - Analyzer precision and regression hardening\n\n            Changed:\n            - Hardened cross-rule explicit configuration handling across typed/string/nameof/const ForMember and ForPath selectors, typed ConvertUsing lambdas, constructors, resolvers, converters, and reverse-map boundaries.\n            - Expanded analyzer and code-fix precision across AM001/AM002/AM003/AM004/AM005/AM006/AM011/AM020/AM021/AM022/AM030/AM031/AM032/AM033/AM041/AM050 with stronger false-positive guards, safer automatic fix selection, and broader regression coverage.\n            - Refreshed analyzer-health, rule docs, and release metadata for the current verification baseline.\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (1352 tests)\n            - Focused affected analyzer slice passing on net10.0 (471 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - Analyzer and test projects build clean under -warnaserror (the release gate)\n            - Package smoke passing on net10.0\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.53 - AM032 conditional-access null-handling precision",
